@startuml sm-02-outbox
' SM-02. Запись outbox: письмо или сообщение Telegram.
' Уточняет DV-013, ADR-0007, ADR-0009.
!include _style.iuml
mainframe **state machine** SM-02 Запись outbox
skinparam nodesep 68
skinparam ranksep 110
hide empty description
state "<b>Ожидает</b>" as Wait
state "<b>Отправляется</b>" as Send
state "<b>Отправлена</b>" as Sent
state "<b>Ошибка</b>" as Failed
state "<b>Отменена</b>" as Cancel

[*] -down-> Wait : создана\n/ attempts := 0
Wait -down-> Send : тик 10 с\n[срок наступил]
Send -up-> Wait : ошибка\n[attempts < 3]\n/ +5 мин
Wait -right-> Cancel : канал\nотключён
Send -right-> Cancel : 403\nTelegram
Send -down-> Failed : ошибка\n[attempts = 3]
Send -left-> Sent : успех
Sent -down-> [*]
Failed -down-> [*]
Cancel -down-> [*]
@enduml
